{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CecQqf9jP9AyxkLPoZJ5F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Review complete and committed.\n\n## Verdict: CHANGES-REQUESTED (1 finding)\n\nThe implementation of all seven OI-70/OI-73 Done-when arms is functionally sound and well-tested — I drove the real code paths through the test suite and both harness instruments are clean (`check.py` → `RESULT: PASS`, `trace.py --strict-integrity` → `integrity=0`). Every Done-when item maps to a covering test, and the cancelled-close regression correctly models the pre-fix `brief=\"\"` gap so it would fail against the old brief-only guard.\n\n**The one blocker is a red bar, not a logic defect:** `intake.py` measures **1177 SLOC** but its committed ratchet baseline is **1179**, so `test_module_size_ratchet::test_module_sizes_exactly_match_the_committed_baseline` **fails in the smoke tier on the clean committed HEAD** (`f1a7e6b8`). A later ruff/format pass shrank the module without the ratchet being re-stamped down in the same commit. This makes the per-commit bar red and directly falsifies the WI Deliverable's claim of \"Smoke tier green within budget; full unfiltered suite green (close commit).\"\n\nThe fix is trivial (re-stamp the `intake.py` entry to 1177 with a DOWN note, per that file's own rule, then re-run `-m smoke`), but a WI cannot close with a red smoke bar — hence CHANGES-REQUESTED rather than APPROVE.\n\nThings I checked and cleared (no finding): OI-id collision safety (the `_mint`'s `bump_watermark` raises the OI space because `_offspine_ids` counts open-items.toml); the merge-side self-close refusal guard reads the durable `dispose:` title, not the cleared `specref` or the brief-less cancelled arm; `_replace_inbound_edges` touches only the hard `needs` edge surgically and leaves soft/terminal rows alone; the minted sparse OI row renders without erroring; and the template CSV / PROCESS_OPTIONS / brief prose are mutually consistent with the widened grammar."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":759,"cache_read_input_tokens":116003,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":759},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d7b3dd5-eeb9-4779-8776-7a4759b8cb71","uuid":"884f31d5-9cd9-4f8b-8f97-28f9012a1898","request_id":"req_011CecQqeGtsFE3XHwBSKxck"}
